---
// Contrast fix for the CTA band button (F15 / DESIGN.md 2.2): the highlight word inside the teal
// button ("Get in touch <span>now!</span>") picks up the on-light highlight from the grey band
// (#5f969c on #1c5156 = 2.68:1, axe color-contrast). Inside the teal button it is on a teal surface,
// so it takes the on-teal highlight; on hover the theme already turns it teal on the light fill.
// Requested as a shared change in overrides.css; kept here until then.
---
<style is:global>
  #project-cta .project-cta__btn, #sector-cta .sector-cta__btn { --hl: var(--teal-light-text); }
</style>
